# Engine build products, ignored defensively. Engine projects never live at the repo root: an Unreal or Godot game
# project goes under engines/<engine>/ (see ARCHITECTURE.md → Repository layout), so these only match inside it.
engines/*/Binaries/
engines/*/DerivedDataCache/
engines/*/Intermediate/
engines/*/Saved/
engines/*/.godot/
